  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_351c769d-d917-40a8-99f9-af50c2d11e67.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"110\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_c485785a-36d2-40be-a54b-645516080708.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"663\" height=\"161\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_d8d9d040-8530-49c0-aa07-b625ab41bbd0.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"134\" height=\"182\"></p><p>高效整合 Minecraft 功能，尽在单一模组。<br>快速、友好、适用于所有人！<br><br></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_aa30b0ec-f53f-442a-ba07-ef605e1913c8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"278\" height=\"46\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_c35b1afc-f5e5-442b-8e96-0ec7832aaa98.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"349\" height=\"75\"></p><p>托管你的 Minecraft 世界，邀请好友，<br>只需几次点击，即可一起游玩！<br><br></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dkjQ9yp-BHw\" width=\"850\" height=\"499\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_b8b91c96-06be-4ba6-911c-eb14e878a778.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"409\" height=\"75\"></p><p>在 Minecraft 中与好友保持联系。<br>聊天、创建群组、分享图片，以及发送世界和服务器邀请。<br><br></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_6f119fd9-768b-478c-9152-a86a941b0da3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_2f81c933-fe08-45ef-9a67-6943a835a498.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"481\" height=\"75\"></p><p>利用 Essential 的强大功能，<br>节省时间和精力。<br><br></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_f0d5a2f4-3ea7-427d-a9a6-b0f90ecdf68a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"547\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_5df79350-601a-4759-9a9d-713ec00ba970.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"30\"></p><p><strong>Essential 能与其他模组和模组包一起使用吗？</strong><br>可以。Essential 广泛兼容其他模组，是你喜爱模组包的绝佳补充。你可以免费轻松地为你和好友托管模组世界，只需确保他们安装了相同的模组即可。</p><p><strong>Essential 支持哪些 Minecraft 版本？</strong><br>Essential 模组支持 Minecraft Java 版中最流行的版本（1.8、1.12、1.16 至 26.1），并兼容 Fabric 和 Forge 两种模组加载器。</p><p><strong>Essential 的世界托管是如何工作的？</strong><br>Essential 采用行业领先的点对点技术，并利用你个人电脑的硬件性能，让你能够轻松免费地托管 Minecraft 世界并邀请好友。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fwiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_5343762a-3d8a-4948-9368-9c1feaab4928.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"162\" height=\"15\"><br><br><br></a>© ModCore Inc, Spark Universe GmbH 2024<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fwiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>",
